    "Google Play rejected this reply. Replies are limited to about %lld characters — shorten it and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when Google rejects a review reply (HTTP 400), usually because it is too long. Argument: the approximate character limit (350).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
