    },
    "The Developer ID must be the number from the Play Console URL: the digits after /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). You can paste the whole URL." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when the Google Play developer ID entered isn't a number or a Play Console URL containing one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Entwickler-ID muss die Nummer aus der Play-Console-URL sein: die Ziffern nach /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Du kannst die ganze URL einfügen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El ID de desarrollador debe ser el número de la URL de Play Console: los dígitos después de /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Puedes pegar la URL completa."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El ID de desarrollador debe ser el número de la URL de Play Console: los dígitos después de /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Puedes pegar la URL completa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ID de développeur doit être le numéro de l'URL de la Play Console : les chiffres après /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Vous pouvez coller l'URL entière."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ID sviluppatore deve essere il numero nell'URL di Play Console: le cifre dopo /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Puoi incollare l'intero URL."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "デベロッパー ID は Play Console の URL にある番号（/developers/ の後の数字）である必要があります（play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list）。URL 全体を貼り付けることもできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "개발자 ID는 Play Console URL의 번호, 즉 /developers/ 뒤의 숫자여야 합니다(play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). 전체 URL을 붙여넣어도 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De ontwikkelaars-ID moet het nummer uit de Play Console-URL zijn: de cijfers na /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Je kunt de hele URL plakken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O ID de desenvolvedor deve ser o número da URL do Play Console: os dígitos depois de /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Você pode colar a URL inteira."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O ID de programador tem de ser o número do URL da Play Console: os dígitos depois de /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Pode colar o URL completo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ID разработчика — это номер из URL Play Console: цифры после /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Можно вставить URL целиком."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utvecklar-ID:t måste vara numret från Play Console-URL:en: siffrorna efter /developers/ (play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list). Du kan klistra in hela URL:en."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開發人員 ID 必須是 Play Console 網址中的號碼：/developers/ 後面的數字（play.google.com/console/u/0/developers/<ID>/app-list）。你可以貼上完整網址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The expired invitation was removed, but the new one couldn't be sent. Invite %@ again.\n%@" : {
