    "To manage users, the Google account %@ needs the “Admin (all permissions)” permission in Play Console › Users and permissions." : {
      "comment" : "Google Play users screen, account added with Sign in with Google. The placeholder is that Google account's e-mail.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zum Verwalten von Nutzern benötigt das Google-Konto %@ die Berechtigung „Administrator (alle Berechtigungen)“ in der Play Console › Nutzer und Berechtigungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para gestionar usuarios, la cuenta de Google %@ necesita el permiso “Administrador (todos los permisos)” en Play Console › Usuarios y permisos."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para administrar usuarios, la cuenta de Google %@ necesita el permiso “Administrador (todos los permisos)” en Play Console › Usuarios y permisos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour gérer les utilisateurs, le compte Google %@ doit disposer de l’autorisation « Administrateur (toutes les autorisations) » dans Play Console › Utilisateurs et autorisations."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per gestire gli utenti, l’account Google %@ deve avere l’autorizzazione “Amministratore (tutte le autorizzazioni)” in Play Console › Utenti e autorizzazioni."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ユーザーを管理するには、Google アカウント %@ に Play Console › ユーザーと権限 で「管理者（すべての権限）」の権限が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용자를 관리하려면 Google 계정 %@에 Play Console › 사용자 및 권한에서 ‘관리자(모든 권한)’ 권한이 있어야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om gebruikers te beheren, heeft het Google-account %@ de rechten ‘Beheerder (alle rechten)’ nodig in Play Console › Gebruikers en rechten."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para gerenciar usuários, a conta do Google %@ precisa da permissão “Administrador (todas as permissões)” em Play Console › Usuários e permissões."
