    },
    "To read and publish your Remote Config, Google needs one more permission (Google Cloud access). StackConnect asks for it only now, when you open Remote Config." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um deine Remote Config zu lesen und zu veröffentlichen, braucht Google eine weitere Berechtigung (Google Cloud-Zugriff). StackConnect fragt erst jetzt danach, wenn du Remote Config öffnest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para leer y publicar tu Remote Config, Google necesita un permiso más (acceso a Google Cloud). StackConnect solo lo pide ahora, al abrir Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para leer y publicar tu Remote Config, Google necesita un permiso más (acceso a Google Cloud). StackConnect solo lo pide ahora, al abrir Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour lire et publier votre Remote Config, Google a besoin d’une autorisation supplémentaire (accès à Google Cloud). StackConnect ne la demande que maintenant, à l’ouverture de Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per leggere e pubblicare il tuo Remote Config, Google ha bisogno di un’altra autorizzazione (accesso a Google Cloud). StackConnect la chiede solo ora, quando apri Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remote Config の読み取りと公開には、Google の追加の権限（Google Cloud へのアクセス）が必要です。StackConnect は、Remote Config を開いたこのタイミングでのみ権限をリクエストします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remote Config를 읽고 게시하려면 Google 권한(Google Cloud 접근)이 하나 더 필요합니다. StackConnect는 Remote Config를 여는 지금에만 이 권한을 요청합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om je Remote Config te lezen en te publiceren, heeft Google nog één toestemming nodig (toegang tot Google Cloud). StackConnect vraagt hier pas nu om, wanneer je Remote Config opent."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para ler e publicar seu Remote Config, o Google precisa de mais uma permissão (acesso ao Google Cloud). O StackConnect só a pede agora, ao abrir o Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para ler e publicar o seu Remote Config, a Google precisa de mais uma autorização (acesso ao Google Cloud). O StackConnect só a pede agora, ao abrir o Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Чтобы читать и публиковать вашу Remote Config, Google нужно ещё одно разрешение (доступ к Google Cloud). StackConnect запрашивает его только сейчас, когда вы открываете Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "För att läsa och publicera din Remote Config behöver Google ytterligare en behörighet (åtkomst till Google Cloud). StackConnect ber om den först nu, när du öppnar Remote Config."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若要讀取及發布 Remote Config，Google 需要多一項權限（Google Cloud 存取權）。StackConnect 只會在你開啟 Remote Config 時才要求此權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To show your Google Analytics reports, Google needs one more permission. StackConnect only reads your Analytics data and never changes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um deine Google Analytics-Berichte anzuzeigen, braucht Google eine weitere Berechtigung. StackConnect liest deine Analytics-Daten nur und ändert sie nie."
